{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"﻿"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1B4RMPSJWSS9649W7QDPRS","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小田倉さん好きい〜\nお花のピンは今日のためにお友達が買ってくれたの☺︎\nリボンはれなが結んでくれたの☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リアルミーグリありがとうございました🌸\nみんなに会えて本当に嬉しかったよ〜☺️\n楽しい時間をありがとう。！！\nまた改めて京都の時の写真と一緒に\nブログ書きたいと思うので待っててね☺️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1B4SPWT005883JX4EQWNQT","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"遅くなりましたが\n2024年のはじまりは\nお正月気分、、ではなくエンジン全開で\nスタートしました！！❤️‍🔥"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1月5日、EXシアター六本木で開催された\n\"あつまれ！サクラミーツ新年会\"\nご来場いただいた皆さま\n配信で観て下さった皆さま\n本当にありがとうございます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"豪華すぎるゲストの皆様と\n松田、大園、璃花ちゃんも来てくれて"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんのコントやゲーム、\nトークに漫才、\n幕間のドラマやTikTokショートネタ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"盛りだくさんの昼夜2公演を終えた後は\n本当にやり切った達成感でいっぱいでした"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中\n大好きなサクラミーツのスタッフさんから\nこんな素敵なプレゼントをいただいてしまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1B4TRKA5JVRYM24DQ8A01D","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"😭😭😭😭😭😭😭\n泣きました、、愛しかないです…\n嬉しかったです😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"元々の予定では\n配信のアーカイブが観られるのが今日までだったのですが…"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんと好評につき\n1/31(水) 23:59まで\n配信期間が延長されたとのことです😭❕"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"嬉しいいいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どんどん配信限定のものが追加されており"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"・昼ミーツ本編\n・夜ミーツ本編\n・武元D撮影‼︎ここだけ舞台裏動画\n・オリジナルドラマ撮影風景&インタビュー\n・貴重なネタ稽古&当日舞台裏"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちら全部見ることができるんですって、、\n最後の映像は30分を超えるドキュメンタリーでびっくりでした、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"是非、ぜひです！！☺️🤍"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1B4VSGRY0H1HAG72ZYMM5Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1B4WT9NW6TVPEZQ7TDWZN0","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1B4XWBS3BJNDNQV73V3HCA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいお花もありがとうございました🥺💐"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1B4YX174636PTJR8KJFTVD","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1B4ZXPK1QA08HTG7ZSTPNH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1B50ZBCF4ZXPKX5MMA8ZXA","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1B5206Q209EGMFFKFKJCQC","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"男性ブランコの平井さんが\n書き下ろしてくださったオリジナルドラマ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"笑いあり涙ありの素敵な作品を\nプレゼントしてくださり、\n感謝の気持ちでいっぱいです😭"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こちらも是非観てほしいです☺︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！！\nまたすぐ書きます！\n今日幕張に来て下さった皆さま\n朝から寒かったと思うので\nゆっくりお風呂に浸かって\nあったかくして寝てね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ🌛"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ1B52ZR9T6FM2XGES1HC19J","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"}],"source":"archive"}